msgid "Optional. When enabled, Rezolve Ai receives one aggregate row per crawler per day (crawler name, date, hit count). No IP addresses, cookies, or personal information ever leave your site. This setting covers crawlers only; visitor pageviews are a separate setting below and are off unless you turn them on."
